cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software-code
message: "Cite this repository at the commit or tag you read. Tag v0.1.1 is the first published version, with twenty-one Comparator entries at one commit on one Mathlib pin. The earlier tag v0.1.0 was superseded before publication. No entry has had human peer review."
title: "Plectis Erdős Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cook"
    given-names: "Will"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Lean 4 formalizations from research on eight Erdős problems (#68, #243, #249, #251, #257, #269, #1041, #1049), in 38 theorem families and 143 entries ordered by the papers. Each entry states a theorem, proves it against Mathlib with no sorry on the proof side, prints the axioms it depends on, and records in its metadata what the theorem does not reach. #1041 is answered for the exact Formal Conjectures statement using ani's counterexample, and the other seven problems remain open. Novelty is recorded as unassessed wherever the literature does not settle it."
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal mathematics"
  - "number theory"
  - "Erdős problems"
  - "irrationality"
  - "polynomial geometry"
  - "proof verification"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcook04/plectis-erdos-lean"
version: "v0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
